  "query_preview": "..\n(Tuesday night through Sunday)\nIssued at 115 AM CDT Mon Aug 24 2026\n\nThe upper ridge continues to shift west and centers over the AZ/NM \nstate line by Wednesday. This will place our region in NW flow aloft \nand open the door for thunderstorms to move off the NM mountains and \ninto our area late in the day. Scattered storms are again possible \nThursday before the ridge moves back overhead and subsidence \nincreases. Hot conditions will continue, but highs look to stay just \nunder 100 for most locations Thursday/Friday. Hotter conditions \nreturn for the weekend.",
